  "name": "TIDE-ou_relam70_256_fp64",
  "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tTIDE - ou_relam70_256_fp64\n\t\n\nPaper: arXiv:2608.04222 | Index / datasheet: ydai17/TIDE | Code: GitHub\nOne configuration of TIDE (Turbulent Incompressible DNS Ensembles): a 256^3\nfp64 direct numerical simulation of the incompressible Navier-Stokes equations,\nshipped as independent realizations and released only after passing a fixed\nacceptance standard of statistical gates and equation-level residual checks.\n\nIndex of all configurations: https://huggingface.co/datasets/ydai17/TIDE\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/ydai17/TIDE-ou_relam70_256_fp64.",
